{"strongs": "H7541", "word": "רַקָּה", "translit": "raq.qah", "root": "רקק", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "the temple", "definition": "רַקָּה noun feminine the temple (of the head): Judg 4:21 וַתִּתְקַע הַיָּתֵד בְּרַקָּתוֺ , v Judg 4:22 ; Judg 5:26 וּמָֽחְצָה וְחָֽלְפָה רִקָּתוֺ , Song 4:3 = Song 6:7 כְּפֶלַח הָרִמּוֺן רִקָּתֵךְ .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8115')\">BDB8115</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H7541')\">H7541</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8114')\">BDB8114</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8116')\">BDB8116</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>רַקָּה</bdbheb> <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>the temple</highlightword> (of the head): <ref ref=\"Judg 4:21\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(7,4,21)\">Judg 4:21</ref> <bdbheb>וַתִּתְקַע הַיָּתֵד בְּרַקָּתוֺ</bdbheb>, v<ref ref=\"Judg 4:22\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(7,4,22)\">Judg 4:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 5:26\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(7,5,26)\">Judg 5:26</ref> <bdbheb>וּמָֽחְצָה וְחָֽלְפָה רִקָּתוֺ</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Song 4:3\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(22,4,3)\">Song 4:3</ref> = <ref ref=\"Song 6:7\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(22,6,7)\">Song 6:7</ref> <bdbheb>כְּפֶלַח הָרִמּוֺן רִקָּתֵךְ</bdbheb>. </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Judg 4:21", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 4, "verse": 21}, {"raw": "Judg 4:22", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 4, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "Judg 5:26", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 5, "verse": 26}, {"raw": "Song 4:3", "book": "SNG", "chapter": 4, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Song 6:7", "book": "SNG", "chapter": 6, "verse": 7}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["רַקָּה", "וַתִּתְקַע הַיָּתֵד בְּרַקָּתוֺ", "וּמָֽחְצָה וְחָֽלְפָה רִקָּתוֺ", "כְּפֶלַח הָרִמּוֺן רִקָּתֵךְ"], "aramaic": [], "greek": [],